<title>USA: Hon Industries Q4 net up on cost cuts.</title>
<headline>Hon Industries Q4 net up on cost cuts.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCATINE, Iowa 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hon Industries Inc said Tuesday a 146-percent increase in net income in the fourth quarter ended December 28 is directly related to a significant reduction in operating expenses.</p>
<p>The company reported net income of $21.1 million, up from $8.6 million one year ago. Sales climbed 20 percent to $290.1 million, compared to $241.8 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Hon Industries makes medium-priced office furniture in addition to manufacturing fireplaces.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading down 3/4 Tuesday at 36-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
